{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265u29f9Mt8s1792730456.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>強颱風薔琵迫近日本沖繩，帶來強風大雨。</p><p></p><p>石垣島早上風勢增強。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xDaC90KOlT1792730459.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>日本氣象廳稱，薔琵的陣風風速高達每小時216公里，足以吹倒部分房屋，預計沖繩縣截至周六早上的24小時降雨量，可能達到250毫米，宮古島多個監測站已錄得每小時降雨量51至61毫米，創下10月降雨紀錄。</p><p></p><p>當局警告，宮古島和八重地區不排除會形成線狀雨帶，大雨災害風險急升，並可能出現12米高的海浪，呼籲民眾提高警覺。逾200班航班已取消，連接沖繩本島和周邊離島的過百條渡輪航線停航。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:53.274889+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.280477+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:09.072592+00:00","content_hash":"02554888d4e69174d929a4b361a6644dbd4919c46ec294d811fe60e9ee68a792","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:53.274889+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}